fact WorkItem(id: "WI-342", description: some(value: "Entity-representation migration / §8 core (path A) — make denoted carry a NodeOccurrence and route the typer's type-unification onto TermView. Spec: docs/design/entity-representation-term-or-value.md. Carrier rule: a denoted carries a NodeOccurrence (non-hash-consable) so any entity transitively containing a denoted must be a Value, recursively (Type AND EffectExpression). Representation (decided): a Value-carried type is Value::Node(Rc<NodeOccurrence{kind: NodeKind::Type(TypeNode)}>) — NodeKind::Type added as a sibling kind mirroring the WI-318 Pattern precedent; TypeNode is a new enum mirroring the Type sort (sort_ref/parameterized/arrow/denoted/effects_rows/named_tuple/type_var/nothing), holding TermId for ground subtrees and Box<TypeNode>/Rc<NodeOccurrence> only on the denoted-poisoned spine. PHASES (each independently green): P1 substrate-only add (NodeKind::Type + TypeNode + the 4 mandatory walkers drain/for_each/reassemble/debruijn-open+close + as_type + new_type + occ_* view arms in term_view.rs; populated-but-not-consumed; zero behavior change; LOW risk). P2 first producer behind a NEW builder make_denoted_occ + upward Value-carriage propagation, route ONE loader site, dual-path (make_denoted/Ref consumers untouched; MEDIUM). P3 route unify_types onto TermView validated against P2 — re-express structural reads via head/pos_arg/named_arg, switch var-bind to bind_value+as_bind_value, KEEP variance/row arms as type-specific relations; 17 callers keep passing TermId via TermIdView (HIGHEST risk). P4 widen loader sites + migrate Ref-denoted consumers (extract_effect_resource_sym/region.rs/unwrap_denoted_value) + retire make_denoted. Chicken-and-egg broken by additive-substrate-first then dual-path then narrow-vertical then widen. Two unifications stay DISTINCT relations (resolver match_view exact vs typer subtype) sharing only the TermView+Substitution substrate. Open: equality/caching for Value-carried types (TermId== fast paths lose O(1)); propagation-lift location (builders vs normalizer); TypeNode arm granularity; alpha-equivalence home (unblocked by P3). Subsumes WI-341 step 2."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-06-14T20:11:37Z"))

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "user", content: "PHASING REFINEMENT (found on starting P1): TypeNode's shape cannot be safely pinned strictly substrate-first. Its variant granularity (TermId-ground vs Box<TypeNode>/Rc<NodeOccurrence> on the denoted spine) and its De Bruijn open/close traversal over the denoted-occurrence are only validated by the P2 producer (how make_denoted_occ + Value-carriage build one) and the P3 consumer (how unify_types/arrow_parts/row-fns read it). Defining a full TypeNode + untestable walker arms in isolation risks churning it in P2. So fold P1+P2 into ONE narrow end-to-end vertical slice: pick the smallest real denoted-bearing type (e.g. a single {-Modify[c]} effect row from one loader site behind make_denoted_occ), and define exactly the TypeNode shape + walkers that slice needs, validated by its own producer+view. Strict substrate-first stays the right instinct ONLY for the parts whose shape is consumer-independent (the NodeKind::Type variant existence + as_type/new_type + Drop totality); the TypeNode internals come with the producer. STATUS: representation decided (Value::Node(NodeKind::Type(TypeNode))); WI-342 phases + grounded touch-points filed; design doc updated; claimed. Next focused step: implement the P1+P2 narrow slice together. No code landed yet (deliberately — avoided pinning an unvalidated TypeNode shape under a long session's tail).", at: "2026-05-29T11:56:36Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "user", content: "P1+P2 NARROW SLICE LANDED (status stays Claimed; P3/P4 remain). Decisions locked: slice target = {-Modify[c]} effect row; EffectExpression carrier = sibling NodeKind::EffectExpr (WI-318 Pattern precedent); bindings = Rep A (collapse into TypeNode::Parameterized{bindings: Vec<(Symbol,TypeChild)>}, defer generic cons-list view to P3). DELIVERED: (substrate) NodeKind::Type(TypeNode)+EffectExpr(EffectExprNode)+TypeChild{Ground(TermId)|Node(Rc<NodeOccurrence>)} in node_occurrence.rs, total Drop drain, as_type/as_effect_expr/new_type/new_effect_expr; (producer) make_denoted_occ[_ref]/make_parameterized_occ/make_arrow_occ/make_effects_rows_occ/make_{present,absent,merge,open,empty_row}_occ in mod.rs (dual-path, &self wrappers, NO live loader caller); (view) occ_* TermView arms read the new kinds carrier-identically (occ_head/occ_named_keys/occ_type_named in term_view.rs, kb threaded into the occ_* helpers). Spine for {-Modify[c]}: arrow->effects_rows->merge(absent,empty_row)->absent->parameterized(base ground sort_ref, binding value poisoned)->denoted(value: Expr::Ref(c) occ). Ground subtrees stay TermId. Validated by kb::tests::wi342_value_carried_modify_c_arrow_reads_through_termview. Full workspace test.sh green; zero live-path regression (wi314_region_mask/wi219_modify_transitivity untouched). /code-review (high) run: fixed the one real bug = collector/rewriter asymmetry (var-collectors occurrence_has_unbound_var/collect_occurrence_global_vars{,_ordered} were wrongly descending Type/EffectExpr while rewriters substitute_occurrence/open_debruijn_node/node_to_debruijn no-op them); collectors now debug_assert!(false) on these kinds (not silent {}), per errors-early. DEFERRED TO P3 (recorded in code comments): (a) route unify_types onto TermView (10 external TermId callers->TermIdView; bind via as_bind_value+bind_value; walk_type/occurs_in dispatch on Value::Node via resolve_as_value; add denoted arm to unify_types/types_compatible which today rely on hash-cons identity, typing.rs:5901-5907); (b) for_each_*/rewriter/DeBruijn walker arms for Type/EffectExpr (add with collectors when a producer first puts a type in a walked body); (c) generic cons-list view of parameterized.bindings; (d) KB-cached TypeSyms (mirror ReflectSyms) to replace per-call format!/lookup_symbol + the head-arity-vs-keys filter_map silent-drop. P4: widen loader sites + migrate Ref-denoted consumers (extract_effect_resource_sym/region.rs/unwrap_denoted_value) + retire make_denoted.", at: "2026-05-29T15:01:09Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "user", content: "P3 FIRST SLICE LANDED (status stays Claimed; structural arms + P4 remain). unify_types MIGRATED to carrier-agnostic: signature now unify_types<A: TermView, B: TermView>(kb, subst, a: &A, b: &B) — NOT a TermId facade (per user: migrate it, don't facade). Resolved type = Value (consistent with Substitution.bindings: HashMap<VarId,Value>): Value::Term = hash-consed carrier (O(1) identity + unify_term_dispatch = verbatim old functor dispatch), Value::Node = occurrence type, Value::Var = logic var. New helpers in typing.rs: walk_view (as_bind_value -> walk_term_to_resolved/walk_value_to_resolved), resolved_var, bind_resolved (bind_term/bind_value by carrier), resolved_functor_name, unify_denoted_view, denoted_ref_sym, occurs_in_view, unify_term_dispatch (extracted old dispatch). denoted arm: carrier-agnostic Ref-symbol compare (cross-carrier ground<->Node), alpha-eq TODO for non-Ref. ALL 16 internal + 26 typing_test.rs call sites wrapped &TermIdView. var_types: HashMap<u32,TermId> -> HashMap<u32,Value> (real migration, holds Value::Term today, ready for Value::Node when OperationInfo migrates in P4). occurrence_structural_eq (node_occurrence.rs) gained Type/EffectExpr arms (type_node_eq/effect_expr_node_eq/type_child_eq) so bind_value contradiction-check doesn't falsely contradict equal Value-carried types. Validated: 4 new kb::typing::p3_tests (var<->Value denoted bind+resolve; cross-carrier denoted unify same/diff sym; ground denoted unchanged; bind_value structural-eq no-false-contradiction) + full workspace test.sh green (WI-307/328 row, wi314/wi219, all 26 typing_test unify tests byte-identical behavior). /code-review high: no live bug; fixed one efficiency regression (denoted functor-name check was on the hot (Term,Term) path -> moved to only fire when a Value carrier is involved). DEFERRED TO P4 (latent, no producer mints Value-carried types into live unify yet): (a) structural unify of Value-carried arrow/parameterized/rows (the _ => false arm) — forces unify_arrow/unify_parameterized/row machinery + lacks side-table off TermId; (b) add denoted arm to types_compatible (today unify_types and types_compatible diverge for Value-carried denoted — must close in lockstep when a producer lands); (c) type_node_eq compares Parameterized bindings POSITIONALLY (zip+ka==kb) — uphold the canonical-sorted-named-args invariant in make_parameterized_occ when multi-binding occurrence parameterized are minted; (d) TypeSyms cache (per-call lookup_symbol/format! in view + denoted_ref_sym); (e) loader flip + Ref-denoted consumer migration (extract_effect_resource_sym/region.rs/unwrap_denoted_value) + retire make_denoted.", at: "2026-05-29T16:41:10Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "claude", content: "P4-A LANDED (status stays Claimed; P4-B + P4-B2 remain). Carrier-agnostic STRUCTURAL dispatch for the Value-carrier path: unify_types' _ arm (>=1 Value carrier) now routes to unify_view_structural, which dispatches denoted (existing) + parameterized via TermView, recursing through generic unify_types. New in typing.rs: unify_view_structural; unify_parameterized_view (base both-sides + a-side bindings matched by param name, b-only width-ignored, mirrors unify_parameterized); parameterized_bindings(+_term) carrier-agnostic accessor (gating sub-dependency: Value view exposes only base, Rep A deferred bindings at term_view.rs:194); view_item_value (ViewItem->owned Value, frees kb borrow before &mut recursion); type_child_to_value. unify_denoted_view/denoted_ref_sym now take &mut + kb.intern (was lookup_symbol) so occ-vs-occ denoted unify is robust in a sparse KB (off the (Term,Term) hot path). Validated: 3 new kb::typing::p4_tests (cross-carrier ground<->Value Modify[c] same/diff sym; Value-vs-Value; distinct-base reject) + full anthill-core suite green (10 bins, 0 fail). code-review high: fixed dead match arm + clarified deferral comments. DEFERRED TO P4-B (tracked): (a) row machinery (decompose/pair/cover/bind_row_tail/label_violates_lacks/register_row_lacks + lacks side-table) -> Value labels so {Modify[c]}/{-Modify[c]} arrow unifies cross-carrier through rows; consolidate unify_term_dispatch+unify_view_structural into one generic dispatch and express unify_parameterized via unify_parameterized_view (kill dual-path divergence); (b) types_compatible denoted/parameterized arm (unify/subtype lockstep) BEFORE any loader flip; (c) TypeSyms cache. (e) loader flip + Ref-denoted consumer migration last.", at: "2026-05-29T17:14:41Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "claude", content: "P4-B LANDED (status stays Claimed; P4-B2/#11 types_compatible lockstep + loader flip remain). The headline target is met: a ground arrow Unit->Unit {Modify[c]} now unifies CROSS-CARRIER with its Value-carried twin THROUGH the row machinery (decompose -> pair present labels -> denoted Ref-compare), and {Modify[c]} vs {Modify[d]} is rejected at the effect label. Landed as 3 green sub-commits + review fixes: (B1) representation migration — row labels (present/absent) and the subst.lacks side-table carry carrier-agnostic Value instead of TermId; tail stays TermId (row tails are hash-consable vars); behavior-preserving. (B2a) decompose_effect_row walks the EffectExpression algebra via TermView (not bare TermId), &mut kb + interned field syms; unify_effect_rows generic over the effects carrier; subtype_effect_rows + unify_arrow wrap TermIdView; behavior-preserving (validated by full WI-307/328/336/339 row suite). (B2b) unify_view_structural routes (arrow,arrow)->unify_arrow_view (param/result via generic unify_types, effects via unify_effect_rows); new cross_carrier_modify_c_arrow test. Review fixes: wrapper matched by qualified symbol (not short name); restored ground-label lacks dedup (perf: avoid superlinear growth via bind_row_tail propagation); dropped a divergent top-level (effects_rows,effects_rows) dispatch arm. Full anthill-core suite green throughout (10 bins, 0 fail). STILL DEFERRED (sound _=>false, tracked): (i) bind_row_tail rejects denoted-bearing extras -> OPEN Value-carried rows ({Modify[c]|rho}) false-negative; not live (no non-test producer mints open Value rows); needs make_*_occ row build + bind_value. (ii) Value-carried parameterized-vs-sort_ref + named_tuple dispatch arms. (iii) P4-B2/#11: types_compatible (subtype direction) Value arms — MUST land in lockstep BEFORE any loader flip; note WI-344 just changed type_compatible (provider admissibility) so read it first. (iv) consolidate unify_term_dispatch + unify_view_structural into one generic dispatch (express unify_arrow/unify_parameterized via the *_view fns) + TypeSyms cache (per-call intern). (v) loader flip + Ref-denoted consumer migration (extract_effect_resource_sym/region.rs/unwrap_denoted_value) + retire make_denoted.", at: "2026-05-29T19:44:52Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "claude", content: "P4-B2 LANDED (status stays Claimed; only the loader flip + consumer migration remain). types_compatible (subtype direction) is now carrier-agnostic IN LOCKSTEP with unify_types: generic <A,B:TermView>, (Term,Term)->types_compatible_term_dispatch (old body verbatim, preserves hot path + its no-top-walk contract), Value-carrier side->types_compatible_view_structural. View arms: denoted=equality (unify_denoted_view); arrow->arrow_compatible_view (contravariant param/covariant result/covariant effects); effects_rows->subtype_effect_rows; parameterized->parameterized_compatible_view (iterates EXPECTED bindings, the subtype direction). subtype_effect_rows made generic over the effects carrier (decompose/cover already carrier-agnostic from P4-B). ~23 internal call sites + 2 test helpers (typing_test, wi320_bridge_fact_test) wrapped TermIdView. Each view path mirrors ITS OWN term dispatch (subtype has the effects_rows->subtype_effect_rows arm matching WI-333 term dispatch; unify-view omits it matching unify_term_dispatch's weaker structural arm — the relations were always asymmetric there, that's preserved). Validated: cross_carrier_modify_c_arrow_subtype_lockstep (ground {Modify[c]} arrow <:> Value twin both directions; {Modify[c]} vs {Modify[d]} rejected). Full anthill-core suite green (10 bins). /code-review high: caller-completeness clean; flagged sort_ref/named_tuple view gaps are UNREACHABLE-by-carrier (sort_ref/named_tuple never Value::Node — no denoted to poison; ground children route to term dispatch via named_child_value->Value::Term); only arrow-vs-Function[E] reachable and refused on BOTH sides (lockstep). REMAINING for WI-342 = loader flip + Ref-denoted consumer migration: route the loader site(s) that mint denoted-in-type onto make_denoted_occ (currently make_denoted/Term::Ref), migrate consumers extract_effect_resource_sym/region.rs/unwrap_denoted_value to read Value-carried denoted, retire make_denoted. Also still-deferred minor (sound): bind_row_tail open Value-carried rows ({Modify[c]|rho}); dispatch consolidation (unify_term_dispatch+unify_view_structural into one, express unify_arrow/unify_parameterized/arrow_compatible/parameterized_compatible via the *_view fns); TypeSyms cache (per-call intern on the value-carrier path).", at: "2026-05-29T20:13:10Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "claude", content: "LOADER-FLIP slice 1 (effects-label vertical) E1 LANDED (status Claimed; E2 live-flip + E3 remain). Behavior-preserving representation migration: the typer's effect-label representation moved from Vec<TermId> to carrier-agnostic Vec<Value> END-TO-END (TypeResult.effects, OperationInfoFull.effects, OpInfoRecord.effects, merge_effects, external_effects, extract_effect_resource_sym, region.rs op_boundary_effects/rekey_resource), so a denoted-bearing Value::Node label can flow the whole effect pipeline in E2. Key facts discovered: (1) effects are NOT confined to the region subsystem — TypeResult.effects threads the WHOLE typer via merge_effects (~40 sites), so E1 is the full effect-threading migration, not just region. (2) Effects live in TWO places: the running effect set (TypeResult.effects, migrated) AND inside arrow TYPES (arrow.effects field); a lambda's arrow type is built from its body effects — E1 MATERIALIZES Value::Term->TermId at the make_arrow_type boundary (effects_as_term_ids, lossless), keeping TypeResult.ty as TermId; a Node-bearing lambda arrow type (would need Value ty) is an E2 concern, unreachable pre-E2. (3) OperationInfo effects are stored in a hash-consed KB FACT (TermId cons-list) which CANNOT hold a Value::Node — E2 adds an op_effects side-table mirroring the op_bodies/op_body_node precedent (WI-251/304/305). New value-aware helpers: substitute_ref_syms_value, walk_type_deep_value, effects_as_term_ids, type_display_name_value, push_effect_dedup, rekey_resource_value, extract_effect_resource_sym_term (verbatim old body). The op-boundary undeclared-effect loop dropped the TermId .contains fast-path for the authoritative display-name compare (same outcome). Full anthill-core green (10 bins); /code-review high 2 angles CLEAN (codegen reads parse-IR Operation.effects = different type untouched; eval has no effects reader; no external OpInfoRecord.effects consumers). NEXT E2: kb.op_effects side-table + accessor; loader builds denoted-bearing effect labels as Value::Node via make_*_occ; lookup_operation_info sources from side-table; implement the deferred Node arms in extract_effect_resource_sym/substitute_ref_syms_value/rekey_resource_value (occurrence Ref-rewrite) + type_display_name_value.", at: "2026-05-29T23:35:24Z")

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-342", author: "user", content: "DELIVERED 2026-06-14 (done-but-not-closed sweep; spot-verified GREEN). The entity-representation migration (typer onto TermView; carrier-agnostic denoted->Value::Node) landed across ~30 commits (0b29019->8085b74): P1/P2 substrate+producer, P3 unify_types over TermView (b3a4d9e), P4 structural+types_compatible lockstep (990bce8..0f31beb), loader flip + consumer migration (E1/E2/E3 41e7c4d/90479cd, T8 ee0b5db..8085b74). make_denoted retirement spun to WI-366. Code: term_view.rs:327, node_occurrence.rs (NodeKind::Type), typing.rs carrier-agnostic unify_types/types_compatible. Tests: wi342_e2_modify_c_loads_value_carried, wi342_tyslot_lambda_carries_modify_effect, wi342_value_carried_modify_c_arrow_reads_through_termview, value_value_parameterized_denoted_unify, node_named_tuple_reads_fields_through_termview. Residual deferrals spun to WI-348/353/440. depends_on []; acceptance (cargo-test) met. VERIFIED 2026-06-14: parse_tests -- wi342 = 3 passed / 0 failed. Tracking-only close.", at: "2026-06-14T20:11:33Z")
